opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "SIMD-accelerated xoshiro256 PRNG"
description: """
A fast, non-cryptographic pseudo-random number generator using SIMD-accelerated
xoshiro256++ (integer output) and xoshiro256+ (float output), with bulk
Bigarray fill functions and an interface compatible with the OCaml standard
Random module."""
